        <detaileddescription>
<para>Property: name_index</para><para>The value of the name_index item must be a valid index into the constant_pool table. The constant_pool entry at that index must contain a CONSTANT_Utf8_info structure representing a valid unqualified name denoting a local variable (see JVM specification, 4.2.2). </para>        </detaileddescription>
